    "body": "Most apps are designed to capture attention, harvest data, and keep you scrolling. We build tools designed differently.\n\nThrough privacy-first AI and thoughtful design, we create software grounded in human sovereignty—protecting your privacy, respecting your attention, and supporting your self-knowledge.\n\n*We work at the intersection of cutting-edge engineering and human-centered design—building technology that serves rather than extracts.*",
    "bodyStyle": {
     "fontFamily": "ui-sans-serif",
     "fontSizePx": 18,
     "fontWeight": 400,
     "letterSpacingPx": 0,
     "lineHeightPx": 29,
     "color": "#314158"
    }
   }
