    "spacingTop": "xl",
    "spacingBottom": "2xl",
    "contentWidth": "4xl"
   },
   "content": {
    "heading": {
     "text": "The Alchemy",
     "fontFamily": "ui-sans-serif",
     "fontSizePx": 36,
     "fontWeight": 700,
     "letterSpacingPx": 0,
     "lineHeightPx": 40,
     "color": "#000000"
    },
    "body": "Our name isn't accidental. Alchemy, at its essence, is about transformation—turning lead into gold, base matter into perfection.\n\nBut the deepest alchemical tradition was never really about metals. It was about the self—the work of refining, clarifying, and discovering the gold that's already within.\n\nThat's what we're building: technology for self-transformation. Tools that help you separate signal from noise, access buried wisdom, and become more fully yourself.\n\n> [!accent] We're not trying to change you. We're creating space for you to discover what's already there.",
    "bodyStyle": {
     "fontFamily": "ui-sans-serif",
     "fontSizePx": 18,
     "fontWeight": 400,
     "letterSpacingPx": 0,
     "lineHeightPx": 29,
     "color": "#314158"
    }
   }
